---
title: How do I add a table block to the document?
sidebar:
  order: 4
---
**To add a table block to a document:**

1. **While editing the document, type `/table`.**

1. **A menu will appear showing the option “Table.”**

1. **Click on “Table” to insert a table block into your document.**

1. **A new table will appear where you can add content to its cells.**

**This process will let you add and structure your content into rows and columns within the document.**
